        "explanation": "Chang et al. (2021), Nature Communications, CC BY 4.0. Native JATS paragraph Par6 distinguishes C. neoformans H99 from C. gattii WM276. Paragraph Par12 identifies the URA6 locus CGB_F6195W; Table 2 (Tab2) places its comparison under WM276-derived strains. The reported URA6 comparison does not account for the entire phenotype of the initially observed derivative.",
